Modifications
-------------
Starting 2026-07-16, this repository diverges from upstream Chummer5a as follows:

- The original C#/WinForms codebase was moved, otherwise unchanged, under legacy/.
- A new Python implementation was written under src/ and tests/. It ports Chummer5a's
  character-creation rules logic, reads Chummer5a's game data (legacy/Chummer/data) and UI
  string catalogs (legacy/Chummer/lang) at runtime, and uses Chummer5a's test characters
  (legacy/Chummer.Tests/TestFiles) as a regression oracle.

The full history of both the upstream project and these modifications is in this
repository's git history.

